# mcm: the daily-log folder docs/logs/ (06-11 docs reorg) must NOT be caught
# by the generic "logs" rule above — new daily logs would silently never be
# committed. Existing files stayed tracked; this unignores new ones too.
!docs/logs/
node_modules
npm-debug.log*
package-lock.json
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
packages/excalidraw/types
coverage
dev-dist
html
meta*.json
.claude
